<p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;">If you&rsquo;ve lost your password or want to reset it, use the button below. If you didn&rsquo;t request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;">Your password must be reset within the next <%= User.reset_password_within.inspect %>. If you don&rsquo;t reset it in time, request a new password-reset message from the login page.</p>
<%= render "mailer_shared/cta_button", url: edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token), label: "Reset your password" %>
